msgstr ""
"Linux i686 (التوزيعات المتوافقة مع مواصفات التعبئة [manylinux "
"2014](https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0599/))\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - Windows 10 32-bit\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
